      "description": "The inspected action grammar is create, editAtom, link, transclude, mark and annotate. SemanticEffectFamily separately supplies typed declaration/outcome, evidence and a unique patch. A public-document transform needs a selected computation family and receiving evaluator; a program label or content link alone does not provide those semantics.",
