      "nextAction": "Run repeated native installs and retained-grant use, then expose explicitly authorized generation revocation through the same core. Preserve deliberate management lockout.",
      "closure": "After two admitted rule replacements, previously issued owner/control and delegated grants remain usable exactly when their scope and new rules authorize the new request; stale revisions refuse, explicit generation revocation invalidates prior grants, and restart/retry preserves exact state and receipts. Resource policy can deliberately refuse further management, with no implicit owner bypass.",
